### Fast Food Shop - Authentication API Tests
@accessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjE1LCJlbWFpbCI6InphbG9AZ21haWwuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6ImN1c3RvbWVyIiwiaXNzIjoiZmFzdC1mb29kLXNob3AiLCJhdWQiOiJmYXN0LWZvb2Qtc2hvcC11c2VycyIsImlhdCI6MTc1NTc5ODc4OSwiZXhwIjoxNzU1ODAyMzg5fQ.iNDoH0EMOyA6tNy9YpvM_5TqOeoxQ5fhH4Hv9T7ny-4
@adminToken = admin-token-placeholder


### 1. Đăng ký tài khoản mới
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "zalo@gmail.com",
  "password": "Dinhcongmanh1@",
  "name": "Tien DQ",
  "phone": "0123456789"
}

### 2. Đăng nhập
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "zalo@gmail.com",
  "password": "Dinhcongmanh1@"
}

### 3. Xem profile (cần token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Cập nhật profile (cần token)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Test User",
  "phone": "0987654321"
}


### 5. Đổi mật khẩu (cần token)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Dinhcongmanh1@",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 6. Refresh token (cần token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Quên mật khẩu
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 8. Đăng xuất (cần token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Test quyền admin (cần token admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Test quyền admin (cần token admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
